WEBVTT

00:01:59.407 --> 00:02:00.575
"I have a product,

00:02:00.616 --> 00:02:02.827
but I don't have a market
in which to sell it."

00:02:02.827 --> 00:02:05.830
Or, "I have a market, but it's too small."

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:08.166
So I want to talk
about how to change that.

00:02:08.166 --> 00:02:12.712
Now, just a reminder,
Africa is a continent, not a country.

00:02:13.045 --> 00:02:15.464
And in sub-Saharan Africa,

00:02:15.506 --> 00:02:18.134
agriculture makes up
a large part of the economy.

00:02:18.176 --> 00:02:20.386
It makes up 20 percent of GDP,

00:02:20.386 --> 00:02:22.680
about 60 percent of employment,

00:02:22.722 --> 00:02:25.308
and many of the people
in agriculture are smallholders.

00:02:25.349 --> 00:02:27.518
So they live on less
than two hectares of land

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:31.230
and have very small incomes that put them
at or below the poverty line.